        "在资格成立的时机玩家处于不可操作状态（如受控的脚本化场景）。"
      ],
      "profileId": "sermon-popup",
      "requirements": [
        "GKSA-13"
      ],
      "steps": [
        "在玩家不可操作时观察；预期延后且不显示；检查 ui.playerControllable 为 false、popup.deferredWhilePlayerNotControllable 与 popup.displayedWhilePlayerNotControllable。",
        "读取待显示计数；预期恰好一个；检查 popup.pendingCountDuringDeferral 为 1 且 popup.shown 为 false。"
