      "id": "defer-existing-pause",
      "prerequisites": [
        "存档满足全部门槛且弹窗开关为开启。",
        "在资格成立的时机已存在由其他系统发起的暂停。"
      ],
      "profileId": "sermon-popup",
      "requirements": [
        "GKSA-13"
      ],
      "steps": [
        "在既有暂停期间观察；预期延后且不显示；检查 pause.otherPauseSourceActiveAtEligibility、popup.deferredWhileOtherPause 与 popup.displayedWhileOtherPauseActive。",
        "检查既有暂停是否受影响；预期未受影响；检查 pause.otherPauseSourceUnaffected 为 true。",
        "读取待显示计数；预期恰好一个；检查 popup.pendingCountDuringDeferral 为 1 且 popup.shown 为 false。"
      ],
      "title": "已存在其他暂停来源时延后显示弹窗"
    },
    {
      "category": "defer",
      "evidence": {
        "log": false,
        "measurement": true,
        "screenshot": true
      },
      "expect": [
        {
          "equals": true,
          "observation": "ui.busyGateActiveAtEligibility"
        },
        {
          "equals": false,
          "observation": "ui.busyGateActiveAfterClear"
        },
        {
          "integerGreaterThan": 0,
          "observation": "ui.safetyGateTransitionCount"
        },
        {
          "equals": false,
          "observation": "popup.shownWhileGateActive"
        },
        {
          "equals": true,
          "observation": "popup.shownOnlyAfterGateCleared"
        },
        {
          "equals": true,
          "observation": "popup.displayedAfterGateClearedAndEligible"
        },
        {
          "equals": 1,
          "observation": "popup.displayCountWithinLoad"
        }
      ],
      "id": "defer-busy-gate-race",
      "prerequisites": [
        "存档满足全部门槛且弹窗开关为开启。",
        "资格成立时正处于占用界面，随后占用界面被关闭。"
      ],
      "profileId": "sermon-popup",
      "requirements": [
        "GKSA-13"
      ],
      "steps": [
        "读取资格成立时的安全门状态；预期活动；检查 ui.busyGateActiveAtEligibility 为 true。",
        "读取安全门清空后的状态与转换次数；预期已清空且发生过转换；检查 ui.busyGateActiveAfterClear 为 false 与 ui.safetyGateTransitionCount 为正整数。",
        "观察弹窗；预期仅在清空后显示一次；检查 popup.shownWhileGateActive 为 false、popup.shownOnlyAfterGateCleared 与 popup.displayedAfterGateClearedAndEligible。"
      ],
      "title": "占用界面安全门在资格成立后清空时只在清空后显示一次"
    },
    {
      "category": "defer",
      "evidence": {
        "log": false,
        "measurement": true,
        "screenshot": true
      },
      "expect": [
        {
          "equals": true,
          "observation": "ui.safetyGateClear"
        },
        {
          "equals": true,
          "observation": "popup.eligibilityRecheckedAfterGate"
        },
        {
          "equals": true,
          "observation": "popup.eligibilityStillMet"
        },
        {
          "equals": true,
          "observation": "popup.displayedAfterRecheck"
        }
      ],
      "id": "defer-recheck-after-gate-cleared",
      "prerequisites": [
        "存档满足全部门槛且弹窗开关为开启。",
        "弹窗曾在占用界面期间被延后，随后界面恢复可操作。"
      ],
      "profileId": "sermon-popup",
      "requirements": [
        "GKSA-13"
      ],
      "steps": [
        "待安全门真正清空后重新检查资格；预期已清空并重查；检查 ui.safetyGateClear 与 popup.eligibilityRecheckedAfterGate。",
        "读取资格与显示结果；预期仍满足并显示；检查 popup.eligibilityStillMet 与 popup.displayedAfterRecheck。"
      ],
      "title": "恢复可操作画面后重新检查资格并在仍满足时显示"
    }
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 2
}
